msgid "This writes the individual address {address} to the device whose programming button is pressed. Continue?"
msgstr "Detta skriver den individuella adressen {address} till apparaten vars programmeringsknapp är intryckt. Fortsätta?"

msgid "This overwrites the individual address of the device at its current address with {address}. Its programming button does not need to be pressed."
msgstr "Detta skriver över den individuella adressen för apparaten på dess nuvarande adress med {address}. Dess programmeringsknapp behöver inte tryckas in."

msgid "Current Individual Address"
msgstr "Nuvarande individuell adress"

