msgstr "Ange apparatens nuvarande individuella adress, t.ex. 1.1.5."

msgid "The device already has the individual address {address}."
msgstr "Apparaten har redan den individuella adressen {address}."

msgid "Individual Address via Serial Number"
msgstr "Individuell adress via serienummer"

msgid "This writes the individual address {address} to the device with the serial number {serial}. Its programming button does not need to be pressed."
msgstr "Detta skriver den individuella adressen {address} till apparaten med serienumret {serial}. Dess programmeringsknapp behöver inte tryckas in."

